oader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [315, 58], "pos": [-5058.7177734375, 1556.0489501953125], "id": 528, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.29", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "StyleModelLoader"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "stitch", "links": [1206], "label": "stitch", "type": "STITCH", "localized_name": "stitch"}, {"name": "cropped_image", "links": [1196, 1203, 1204, 1235], "label": "cropped_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "cropped_image"}, {"name": "cropped_mask", "links": [1197, 1205], "label": "cropped_mask", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "cropped_mask"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": [0, 1, false, 0, false, 0, "bicubic", "ranged size", 1024, 1024, 1, 512, 512, 1280, 1280, 8], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 1194, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "mask", "link": 1195, "label": "mask", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "optional_context_mask", "label": "optional_context_mask", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "optional_context_mask"}], "flags": {}, "type": "InpaintCrop", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [352.79998779296875, 386], "pos": [-5724.2001953125, 1360], "id": 572, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-inpaint-cropandstitch", "ver": "1.0.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "InpaintCrop"}, "order": 30}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["\n使用说明\n\n1，上传需要修改的图片\n2，在“需要改哪里”框里填写需要改色的部分，比如:hair,hat,t-shirt.pants,eyes\n3，在“需要改成什么颜色”框里填写需要改的目标的颜色，比如：red,black,blue,pink,Purple, Silver\n4，在“选择精准的颜色”框里点选对应的颜色\n5，设置大模型，分别设置flux fill，ace++ local lora,redux,clip_l.t5xxl,ae\n5，运行工作流\n\n\n此工作流基于 flux fill 底模 ，结合 ACE++ 的 lora，实现了强大的万物改色功能。工作流能在维持物体原有褶皱、形状等细节特征的情况下，实现颜色的自然替换。工作流对于重绘遮罩边缘产生的伪影处理也较为精细。\n在实际应用中，该功能可精准实现发色修改，高效完成服装改色，还能用于多色产品展示。适用于电商创意中商品多色展示图生成，也为艺术创作在色彩调整方面提供有力支持。使用过程遇到问题可留言或入群(QQ群：247228975)免费咨询。\n工作流仍需少量抽卡，所以工作流的升级空间仍很大，作者有时间会接着更新版本。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [323, 354], "pos": [-6727.66943359375, 653.761962890625], "id": 592, "properties": {}, "order": 10}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.17.11", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "groupNodes": {}, "ds": {"offset": [6649.4521484375, -656.0927124023438], "scale": 1.553522046476912}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "1-上传图片", "bounding": [-6325.73828125, 623.7922973632812, 355, 418]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "2-需要改哪里", "bounding": [-5931.53857421875, 623.9733276367188, 250, 197]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "3-需要改成什么颜色", "bounding": [-5648.58203125, 627.628662109375, 235.18341064453125, 188.00352478027344]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "4-选择精准的颜色", "bounding": [-5370.5947265625, 632.0562744140625, 230, 177.60000610351562]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 5, "title": "5-设置大模型", "bounding": [-5081.49755859375, 635.3606567382812, 352.9056091308594, 689.298583984375]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 6, "title": "设置redux模型*2", "bounding": [-5078.95068359375, 1348.539306640625, 717.64013671875, 416.6258544921875]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 7, "title": "模型生图", "bounding": [-4703.8818359375, 641.5181274414062, 1618.4444580078125, 682.35205078125]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 8, "title": "点击筛子改变种子", "bounding": [-2501.423095703125, 1367.85009765625, 253.52000427246094, 379.125]}], "links": [[1046, 505, 0, 507, 0, "IMAGE"], [1047, 505, 1, 508, 0, "MASK"], [1051, 511, 0, 512, 0, "MODEL"], [1052, 512, 0, 513, 0, "MODEL"], [1053, 513, 0, 514, 0, "MODEL"], [1057, 520, 0, 515, 0, "CONDITIONING"], [1058, 520, 0, 51